Output first-run.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme { "background": "#151312", "foreground": "#e9e3dc", "cursor": "#d9784f" }
Hide
Type "export JEVX_HOME=$(mktemp -d) && cd ~/Desktop/globalcare-ai && clear" Enter
Show
Type "npx @vij-sameerb5/jevx --welcome" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 3s
